  "wikitext": "{{PageDisplay}}\n[[File:Apple Tree.png|200px|left|Apple tree]]\n\n{{Infobox\n |title = [[Trees and Bushes|Trees & bushes]]\n |level = 15\n |price = 160\n |gives = {{Infoicon|apple|big|link=Apple}}\n |time = every 16 h\n |xp = 7\n |dia = 13\n}}\n'''Apple trees''' are a type of [[Trees and Bushes|tree]] unlocked at [[experience]] level 15.\n\nEach tree can give up to 13 [[apple]]s, which are collected over 4 harvests.\n\n{{Clr}}----\n==='''Stages'''===\n{| style=\"text-align: center;\"\n|-\n|[[File:Apple Tree Stage 1.png|100px]]\n|[[File:Apple Tree Stage 2.png|100px]]\n|[[File:Apple Tree.png|100px]]\n|[[File:Apple Tree Dead.png|100px]]\n|-\n|'''Stage 1'''\n|'''Stage 2'''\n|'''Ready'''\n|'''Dead'''\n|}\n----\n==='''Buying'''===\n{{Infoicon|shop|bigger|link=Shop}} Apple trees can be purchased in the [[shop]] for 160 {{Infoicon|coin}} each.\n----\n==='''Harvesting'''===\nThe time between harvests is 16 hours for each tree. Each harvest yields additional apples:\n{| style=\"text-align: center;\"\n|-\n|[[File:Apple Tree Harvest 2.png|100px]]\n|[[File:Apple Tree Harvest 3.png|100px]]\n|[[File:Apple Tree.png|100px]]\n|-\n|'''2 apples'''\n|'''3 apples'''\n|'''4 apples'''\n|}\n----\n==='''Reviving'''===\n[[File:Apple Tree Revival.png|150px|left|Apple tree up for revival]]\nAfter the third harvest the tree wilts. A player can ask for another player to revive it by tapping on it and placing a sign on the tree. When another player revives it a final harvest of four apples can be collected before the tree dies. The helper gets 7 {{Infoicon|xp}} points by reviving an apple tree.\n\n{{Clr}}----\n==='''Removing'''===\n[[File:Saw.png|150px|left|link=Saw|Saw]]\nA [[saw]] is needed to remove a dead tree from the farm. Note that players may also use a saw to remove the tree after the third harvest instead of placing it up for revival.\n\n{{Clr}}----\n\n{{Navigation}}\n{{Languages\n|de = Apfelbaum\n|es = Manzano\n|fr = Pommier\n|it = Melo\n|no = Epletre\n|ru = Яблоня\n}}\n\n[[Category:Trees and Bushes]]",
  "wikitextHash": "46641c806161e27d2f9c8990f442509c5642c306cd42dc4a05a6dd104ca0cca7"
